	<section_number>46.2-814</section_number>
	<catch_line>Driving through safety zone prohibited</catch_line>
	<text>
		No driver of a vehicle shall drive through or over a safety zone.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-252; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-242; 1989, c. 727.</history>
